Package: EvoTempo
Title: Covariant Evolutionary Tempo Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Martin R.", "Smith",
           email = "martin.smith@durham.ac.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5660-1727"))
Description: Implements the covariant evolutionary tempo model of Budd and
    Mann (2025) <doi:10.1093/sysbio/syaf020>, in which a heritable log-tempo
    scales speciation, extinction and character change. A discretized-tempo
    formulation provides extinction probabilities with extant and fossil
    sampling, diversity moments and tempo distributions, exact forward
    simulators for discretized and continuous tempo, the exact
    tempo-marginal likelihood of a time tree with fossils, and
    data-augmented Markov chain Monte Carlo over tempo paths, characters
    and time trees.
